 - communication usage/evidence references.
 
 ## Non-ownership
-PLATFORM-011 does not grant identity/delegation/policy/approval truth, does not grant consequential effect authority, does not own artifact bytes, does not own evidence standing, and cannot convert a provider response into canonical domain truth. Remote content remains UNTRUSTED_EXTERNAL or quarantined.
+PLATFORM-011 does not grant identity/delegation/policy/approval truth, does not grant consequential effect authority, does not own artifact bytes, does not own evidence standing, and cannot convert a provider response into canonical domain truth. Remote content remains UNTRUSTED_EXTERNAL or quarantined. The durable communication-receipt contract preserves both `UNTRUSTED_EXTERNAL` and `QUARANTINED_EXTERNAL` standings exactly as the Java/JSON contract does.
 
 ## Effect law
 HTTP method is not an effect classifier. READ_ONLY and EXTERNAL_EFFECT are explicit semantics. EXTERNAL_EFFECT requires an exact PLATFORM-010 action request + authorization binding. A GET can be consequential and a POST can be read-only; method names never bypass the effect gate.
